}]\\n21:null\\n25:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor — DigiRobotics\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Agentic commerce is getting serious infrastructure — programmable stablecoin settlement, one-purchase credentials, multi-rail access. The creator economy has a proven playbook. Both trends converge on the contributor: recording real-world tasks is becoming a paid profession with agents as its buyers.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"manifest\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/manifest.webmanifest\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:title\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Agentic commerce is getting serious infrastructure — programmable stablecoin settlement, one-purchase credentials, multi-rail access. The creator economy has a proven playbook. Both trends converge on the contributor: recording real-world tasks is becoming a paid profession with agents as its buyers.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:url\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:image\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:image:alt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:type\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"article\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"article:published_time\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"2026-11-20\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"article:modified_time\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"2026-11-20\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"article:author\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"DigiRobotics Team\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:card\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"summary_large_image\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:title\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Agentic commerce is getting serious infrastructure — programmable stablecoin settlement, one-purchase credentials, multi-rail access. The creator economy has a proven playbook. Both trends converge on the contributor: recording real-world tasks is becoming a paid profession with agents as its buyers.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:image\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/x-icon\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"256x256\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/png\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"1254x1254\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"apple-touch-icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/png\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"1254x1254\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2a\\\",\\\"20\\\",{}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"aside\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"hidden lg:block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sticky top-28 border-t border-[var(--primary)] pt-4 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"DigiRobotics\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"br\\\",null,{}],\\\"Field note\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"br\\\",null,{}],\\\"2026.11.20\\\"]}]}]\\n2b:T477,The infrastructure for agentic commerce has graduated from concept to working rails. AI agents can research, compare, and book — and now they can settle, because payment has been rebuilt around software rather than checkout screens. Programmable settlement means stablecoins let payment rules, spending conditions, and authorizations live inside the transaction flow itself, not around it. Workflow-native payment means an agent pays for an API call, dataset access, or model inference as part of completing a task, with no human approving each charge. Single-purpose credentials — newly emerging agentic card mechanisms — give an agent a payment credential created for one specific purchase, bounded by spending limits, merchant categories, and validity windows — then terminated. Multi-rail reality means agents will pay with whatever the transaction requires: programmable stablecoins for digital services, established card and bank rails for traditional merchants. And controls as a design principle means businesses define what an agent represents, what funds it can access, and what it may spend. Freedom is scoped, not absolute.28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-w-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"blockquote\\\",\\\"blockquote-0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-10 border-l-2 border-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/[0.06] px-6 py-2 font-heading text-xl leading-8 text-white sm:px-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"\\\\n\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",\\\"strong-0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"TL;DR:\\\"}]}],\\\"\\\\n\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Agentic commerce has graduated to working rails — programmable stablecoin settlement, one-purchase credentials, and multi-rail access — all within defined permissions. The creator economy has a decade-proven playbook: treat creation as a business, pick a niche, post consistently, diversify channels, know your worth. Both trends converge on the contributor — recording real-world tasks is becoming a paid profession with agents as its buyers. Applying creator-economy discipline to robotics data — niche focus, consistent output, portfolio value, controlled mandates — turns casual capture into a durable business. DigiRobotics is building the platform where experience creators get paid like professionals.\\\"}],\\\"\\\\n\\\"]}],\\\"\\\\n\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"h2-0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Agents Can Now Pay — Within Limits\\\"}],\\\"\\\\n\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$2b\\\"}],\\\"\\\\n\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"h2-1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Contributor Economy Gets Its Playbook\\\"}],\\\"\\\\n\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A parallel professionalization is happening on the supply side. The creator economy spent a decade converting hobbyists into business operators, and its hard-won lessons read like a manual for the coming experience workforce. Treat it as a business — study performance data, build strategy, invest in tools; scale requires infrastructure, not luck. Find your niche and own it — being known for something specific beats being generic; depth in one category compounds trust and pricing power. Consistency over intensity — steady output beats sporadic brilliance; algorithms and buyers both reward reliability. Create for the customer, not yourself — value is measured by what the audience or agent gets, not by what feels expressive. Diversify channels — never depend on a single platform, algorithm, or client. Find your community — peer networks supply accountability, shared learnings, and referrals. Know your worth — professional creators rate their work, negotiate deliberately, and walk away from bad deals.\\\"}],\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L2c\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L2e\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L2f\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L30\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L31\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L32\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L33\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L34\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L35\\\",\\\"\\\\n\\\",\\\"$L36\\\"],\\\"$L37\\\"]}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"footer\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-start\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lb\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/digirobotics/brand/digirobotics-logo.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"DigiRobotics.xyz\\\",\\\"width\\\":210,\\\"height\\\":48,\\\"className\\\":\\\"h-auto w-[190px]\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-white/60\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Egocentric data for robotics training.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"nav\\\",null,{\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Footer navigation\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex max-w-2xl flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Contributor\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/#contributors\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Contributor\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Marketplace\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/#marketplace\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Marketplace\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Custom Data\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/#custom-data\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Custom Data\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Capture Gear\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/gear\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Capture Gear\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Articles\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Articles\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Agent Demo\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/agent-demo\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Agent Demo\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Privacy \\u0026 Terms\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/#privacy-note\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Privacy \\u0026 Terms\\\"}],\\\"$L38\\\"]}]]}],\\\"$L39\\\",\\\"$L3a\\\",\\\"$L3b\\\"]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Now substitute \\\\\\\"audience\\\\\\\" with \\\\\\\"AI agents and robotics labs\\\\\\\" and read the list again. That is precisely the operating manual for a professional contributor of real-world task data.\\\"}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"h2-2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"From Hobbyist to Experience Vendor\\\"}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Put both trends together and a new profession appears: the experience vendor. A worker who wears capture glasses through a shift in a workshop, kitchen, or warehouse is no longer producing idle footage — they're producing inventory for an agent-driven market.\\\"}]\\n2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The creator playbook becomes their business plan. Niche as a product line — specializing in, say, precision assembly tasks, commercial kitchen flows, or automotive repair makes a contributor's data collection predictable and valuable. Consistency as yield — regular validated capture sessions compound into a professional data portfolio, the way daily posting compounds into an audience. Quality as reputation — clean, well-synced, consent-cleared captures raise a vendor's standing, and with it, their per-unit price. Diversified demand — the same portfolio can serve robotics labs, world-model trainers, and evaluation platforms, so no single buyer dictates income. And mandated autonomy — thanks to the controls trend, a contributor can authorize an agent-facing storefront with hard limits: which data on offer, what price floor, what spending caps apply to automated purchases. Agents transact freely, but strictly inside the vendor's mandate.\\\"}]\\n30:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"In this model, income no longer waits for a lab to commission a project. Agents discover, purchase, and settle autonomously — in fractions of a cent or per-capture licenses — while the contributor's rules bound everything.\\\"}]\\n31:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"h2-3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\\\"}]\\n32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"DigiRobotics is designing the marketplace where this profession lives. Its stablecoin-native marketplace for real-world robotics data provides programmable settlement built for agent-initiated purchases, with contributor-defined permissions on every listing. Vendor-grade contributor tooling — niche analytics, capture quality scoring, and portfolio dashboards — lets casual recorders professionalize into experience vendors. Scoped agent storefronts mean every contributor sets the mandate: what data, what floors, what limits — and machine buyers operate strictly within it. Streaming and micro settlement delivers near-instant, continuous income for consistent contributors, echoing the creator economy's path to sustainable earnings. And reputation as capital means verified track records accrue to reliable vendors, unlocking premium demand from fleets and labs.\\\"}]\\n33:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The creator economy taught millions to monetize attention. The DigiRobotics economy pays them for something more durable: experience.\\\"}]\\n34:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"h2-4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Start Building With Us\\\"}]\\n35:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Your workday already contains the data robots need. The only question is whether it stays a hobby — or becomes your portfolio.\\\"}]\\n36:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"p-9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Join DigiRobotics as a contributor, a buyer, or a builder — and help define the paid profession at the heart of agentic commerce.\\\"}]\\n37:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$La\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"size\\\":16,\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],\\\" Return to the archive\\\"]}]}]\\n38:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Contact Us\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\"}]\\n39:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"privacy-note\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\\\"}]]}]\\n3a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$La\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"$14:props:children:0:props:children:props:icon\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"size\\\":18,\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$La\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"$14:props:children:1:props:children:props:icon\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"size\\\":18,\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}]}]]}]\\n3b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\\\"}]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n3:I[60203,[\"66609\",\"static/chunks/66609-81fc326aefa2b35a.js\",\"17112\",\"static/chunks/17112-6d02a7878e38f17b.js\",\"96048\",\"static/chunks/96048-94353edf3fef0226.js\",\"37024\",\"static/chunks/37024-473db45fa25438c6.js\",\"7177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-9ceac550056e754f.js\"],\"ThirdwebSessionProvider\"]\n4:I[35682,[\"66609\",\"static/chunks/66609-81fc326aefa2b35a.js\",\"17112\",\"static/chunks/17112-6d02a7878e38f17b.js\",\"96048\",\"static/chunks/96048-94353edf3fef0226.js\",\"37024\",\"static/chunks/37024-473db45fa25438c6.js\",\"7177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-9ceac550056e754f.js\"],\"CartProvider\"]\n5:I[76826,[\"66609\",\"static/chunks/66609-81fc326aefa2b35a.js\",\"17112\",\"static/chunks/17112-6d02a7878e38f17b.js\",\"96048\",\"static/chunks/96048-94353edf3fef0226.js\",\"37024\",\"static/chunks/37024-473db45fa254