Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"article:modified_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"From Hobby Cam to Registered Data Vendor\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Agentic commerce is getting serious infrastructure — programmable stablecoin settlement, one-purchase credentials, multi-rail access. The creator economy has a proven playbook. Both trends converge on the contributor: recording real-world tasks is becoming a paid profession with agents as its buyers.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/from-hobby-cam-to-registered-data-vendor-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2b\",\"20\",{}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{}]}]]}]\n13:true\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Now substitute \\\"audience\\\" with \\\"AI agents and robotics labs\\\" and read the list again. That is precisely the operating manual for a professional contributor of real-world task data.\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"From Hobbyist to Experience Vendor\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Put both trends together and a new profession appears: the experience vendor. A worker who wears capture glasses through a shift in a workshop, kitchen, or warehouse is no longer producing idle footage — they're producing inventory for an agent-driven market.\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The creator playbook becomes their business plan. Niche as a product line — specializing in, say, precision assembly tasks, commercial kitchen flows, or automotive repair makes a contributor's data collection predictable and valuable. Consistency as yield — regular validated capture sessions compound into a professional data portfolio, the way daily posting compounds into an audience. Quality as reputation — clean, well-synced, consent-cleared captures raise a vendor's standing, and with it, their per-unit price. Diversified demand — the same portfolio can serve robotics labs, world-model trainers, and evaluation platforms, so no single buyer dictates income. And mandated autonomy — thanks to the controls trend, a contributor can authorize an agent-facing storefront with hard limits: which data on offer, what price floor, what spending caps apply to automated purchases. Agents transact freely, but strictly inside the vendor's mandate.\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"In this model, income no longer waits for a lab to commission a project. Agents discover, purchase, and settle autonomously — in fractions of a cent or per-capture licenses — while the contributor's rules bound everything.\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics is designing the marketplace where this profession lives. Its stablecoin-native marketplace for real-world robotics data provides programmable settlement built for agent-initiated purchases, with contributor-defined permissions on every listing. Vendor-grade contributor tooling — niche analytics, capture quality scoring, and portfolio dashboards — lets casual recorders professionalize into experience vendors. Scoped agent storefronts mean every contributor sets the mandate: what data, what floors, what limits — and machine buyers operate strictly within it. Streaming and micro settlement delivers near-instant, continuous income for consistent contributors, echoing the creator economy's path to sustainable earnings. And reputation as capital means verified track records accrue to reliable vendors, unlocking premium demand from fleets and labs.\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The creator economy taught millions to monetize attention. The DigiRobotics economy pays them for something more durable: experience.\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Start Building With Us\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Your workday already contains the data robots need. The only question is whether it stays a hobby — or becomes your portfolio.\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Join DigiRobotics as a contributor, a buyer, or a builder — and help define the paid profession at the heart of agentic commerce.\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" Return to the archive\"]}]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contact Us\",{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy-note\",\"className\":\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\"}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"x\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 6 6 18\",\"key\":\"1bl5f8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m6 6 12 12\",\"key\":\"d8bk6v\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"mail\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\",\"key\":\"132q7q\"}],[\"rect\",{\"x\":\"2\",\"y\":\"4\",\"width\":\"20\",\"height\":\"16\",\"rx\":\"2\",\"key\":\"izxlao\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\",\"children\":\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\"}]\n28:null\na:300\na:C\n12:0\nc:\"$undefined\"\ne:\"$undefined\"\n11:\"$undefined\"\n9:\"$undefined\"\n"}}